  {
   "id": "vaccine-rebirth-236842@1.1",
   "gameId": "vaccine-rebirth-236842",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-06-02T16:33:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "3 new monsters: roaches, plants and alligators",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Zombie modifications: Now they will have random velocity and attacking speed, also 10 new outfits have been created for them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10 new rooms: 6 for the first level and 4 for the second one. New rooms might contain mud on the floor which will make your player move slowly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New weapons: -Machete: Can harm more than 1 target at a time. Extremely short range. Causes medium/high damage.: -Revolver: Long range. Slow reloading time. Causes high damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New items: -Flux capacitor: It will accelerate or decelerate time upon using it.: -Ampoule: This ampoule can replete your health or kill you: -Smart proximity mine: Takes 3 seconds to become active. Does not hurt YOU when exploding.: -Revolver ammo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New difficulty mode (undead)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Three new outfits that will be unlocked when you finish the game in: Very Difficult, Nightmare and Undead",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes and other improvements: • When dropping weapons doesn’t go back to Items: • Fixed collision in some walls, player could go through them: • The last ammo shot makes a different noise to let you know you must reload: • Leaderboards now display hours too: • Player won’t spin if you hold the Draw weapon button while being attacked: • Dogs won’t go through players in some attacks: • PC binding now will check for duplicate keys: • Now enemies can only reduce your damage by 50 HP + 10 more HP for each difficulty level: • Minor adjustments to rooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
